y": "こんにちは。\nガルパンのアンチョビ（安斎 千代美）のイラストが欲しいです。\nワクワクした表情で、制服の上にエプロンをして、手にしている姿を見てみたいです。\n木のスプーン \nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします\n\nOriginal english text\nHello,\nI would like an illustration of Anchovy (安斎 千代美) from Garupan.\nI would like to see her with an excited expression, and wearing an apron over her school uniform, and holding\na wooden spoon. \nThank you for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cafe_dachscafe/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d5e1f900/uploads/origins/2a2c973b-ea23-4347-86e4-73a52e755395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d07ba6c31e3efeba51943f5457006f65", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d5e1f900/uploads/origins/2a2c973b-ea23-4347-86e4-73a52e755395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d07ba6c31e3efeba51943f5457006f65, https://si.imgix.net/d5e1f900/uploads/origins/2a2c973b-ea23-4347-86e4-73a52e755395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b9efccec5f05e38edf4b27340e74c430 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d5e1f900/uploads/origins/2a2c973b-ea23-4347-86e4-73a52e755395?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=167fd47e1c37be58a01ff66f65326882 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@cafe_dachscafe/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b15811e9/uploads/origins/0ab70203-c705-4ec0-8e3b-eeeb61515d34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=95aa69bb34f5f5b8c0a7fff6770da41b", "thumbnail_srcset": "http